{"type":"assistant","uuid":"8b388e5d-30d6-43d2-bf84-36f7301edd23","session_id":"ecb49144-2540-4c5b-ae85-6b6c9450ad71","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"8b388e5d-30d6-43d2-bf84-36f7301edd23","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nAll changes are verified and in place. Here's a summary of the fix:\n\n## Bug Analysis\n\n**Bug:** Undo snackbar action does not work when the item is the only one in the list (Queue, Episodes→New, Episodes→Favorites).\n\n**Root Cause:** When the last item in a list is removed, the RecyclerView transitions from 1 item to 0 items, showing an empty view. When the user presses \"Undo\" to re-add the item, calling `notifyItemInserted()` alone is insufficient to properly display the item. The RecyclerView's internal layout state may not correctly handle the transition from 0 items back to 1 item, causing the new item's view to be positioned outside the visible area (\"moved outside of the screen\").\n\n## Fix Summary\n\nThe fix applies to **3 affected files** covering **3 affected screens**:\n\n### 1. `QueueFragment.java` (Queue screen)\n- **ADDED event handler**: Changed from `notifyItemInserted(position)` to `notifyDataSetChanged()` + `smoothScrollToPosition(0)` to force a full adapter refresh and ensure the item is visible\n- **Added bounds checking**: Validates `event.item` is non-null and `event.position` is within valid range before adding\n- **REMOVED event handler**: Added bounds check for `position >= 0` to prevent potential crash if item not found\n\n### 2. `FavoriteEpisodesFragment.java` (Episodes→Favorites screen)  \n- **Undo action**: Added `listAdapter.notifyDataSetChanged()` + `recyclerView.smoothScrollToPosition(0)` after `DBWriter.addFavoriteItem(item)` to force full UI refresh\n\n### 3. `AllEpisodesFragment.java` (affects Episodes→New via `markItemAsSeenWithUndo`)\n- **Undo action in `markItemAsSeenWithUndo`**: Added `listAdapter.notifyDataSetChanged()` + `recyclerView.smoothScrollToPosition(0)` after `DBWriter.markItemPlayed(FeedItem.NEW, item.getId())` to force full UI refresh\n\nThe patch file is at:\n`/home/antu_shared/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/qwen_original_run3/bug-1130/fix-undo-last-item.patch`"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":100133,"output_tokens":499,"cache_read_input_tokens":98512,"total_tokens":100632}}}
